packages/db/prisma/dev.db

# apps/web's local AI-assistant instruction files — personal/local
# customization, never tracked (previously committed only as
# `@AGENTS.md`, so any real edits underneath always looked like an
# uncommitted diff and kept getting mistaken for stray noise and
# reverted across sessions; gitignoring keeps them out of git's view
# entirely instead).
apps/web/CLAUDE.md
apps/web/AGENTS.md

